# Copy to .env (ignored by git). See docs/experiment_tracking.md.
# The API key does NOT belong here: run `wandb login` once, it is stored in ~/.netrc.

# W&B team (entity) the runs go to. Not a secret: access needs a team invitation.
WANDB_ENTITY=fhnw-cds1

# online (default), offline (log locally, upload later with `wandb sync`) or disabled
# WANDB_MODE=online

# ENTSO-E Transparency Platform token for `make fetch-entsoe` (issue #37, docs/data.md, section 7).
# A secret: put it only into your .env, never into a committed file. The scheduled GitHub Actions
# job reads the repository secret of the same name instead.
# ENTSOE_API_TOKEN=
